UnitAerodromeMigration::DepositVeNFT
├── when the migration is paused
│   └── it should revert with EnforcedPause
└── when the migration is not paused
    ├── when native tokens are sent
    │   └── it should revert with UnexpectedValue
    └── when native tokens are not sent
        ├── when the migration has not opened
        │   └── it should revert with MigrationNotOpen
        └── when the migration has opened
            ├── when the recipient is the zero address
            │   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
            └── when the recipient is not the zero address
                ├── when the v2 veNFT is restricted
                │   └── it should revert with Restricted
                └── when the v2 veNFT is not restricted
                    ├── when the v2 veNFT is locked
                    │   └── it should revert with NotNormalVeNFT
                    ├── when the v2 veNFT is managed
                    │   └── it should revert with NotNormalVeNFT
                    └── when the v2 veNFT is normal
                        ├── when the locked amount is zero
                        │   └── it should revert with NothingToConvert
                        └── when the locked amount is not zero
                            ├── when the v2 veNFT has an active vote
                            │   └── it should revert with AlreadyVoted
                            └── when the v2 veNFT does not have an active vote
                                ├── when the caller does not own the v2 veNFT
                                │   └── it should revert with NotOwner
                                └── when the caller owns the v2 veNFT
                                    ├── when the conversion exceeds the migration budget
                                    │   └── it should revert with BudgetExhausted
                                    └── when the conversion fits within the migration budget
                                        ├── when the v2 lock is permanent
                                        │   ├── when the conversion is within the migration budget
                                        │   │   ├── it should increase the paid basis by the conversion output
                                        │   │   ├── it should record the caller as the depositor
                                        │   │   ├── it should unlock the permanent v2 veNFT
                                        │   │   ├── it should merge the v2 veNFT into the migration veNFT
                                        │   │   ├── it should approve the v3 voting escrow to spend the conversion output
                                        │   │   ├── it should create a permanent v3 staked position
                                        │   │   ├── it should transfer the v3 staked position to the recipient
                                        │   │   └── it should emit the VeNFTMigrated event
                                        │   └── when the conversion exactly exhausts the migration budget
                                        │       ├── it should increase the paid basis by the locked amount
                                        │       ├── it should create a permanent v3 staked position with the locked amount
                                        │       └── it should revert the next conversion with BudgetExhausted
                                        └── when the v2 lock is not permanent
                                            ├── when the v2 lock has expired
                                            │   ├── it should increase the paid basis by the conversion output
                                            │   ├── it should record the caller as the depositor
                                            │   ├── it should not unlock the v2 veNFT
                                            │   ├── it should merge the v2 veNFT into the migration veNFT
                                            │   ├── it should transfer the conversion output to the recipient as liquid tokens
                                            │   ├── it should not create a v3 staked position
                                            │   └── it should emit the VeNFTMigrated event
                                            └── when the v2 lock is active
                                                ├── when the rounded duration is below the maximum v3 stake duration
                                                │   ├── when the migration parameters are known
                                                │   │   ├── it should increase the paid basis by the conversion output
                                                │   │   ├── it should record the caller as the depositor
                                                │   │   ├── it should not unlock the v2 veNFT
                                                │   │   ├── it should merge the v2 veNFT into the migration veNFT
                                                │   │   ├── it should approve the v3 voting escrow to spend the conversion output
                                                │   │   ├── it should create a decay v3 staked position with the remaining duration rounded up to weeks
                                                │   │   ├── it should transfer the v3 staked position to the recipient
                                                │   │   └── it should emit the VeNFTMigrated event
                                                │   └── when the migration parameters vary
                                                │       ├── it should increase the paid basis by the conversion output
                                                │       ├── it should record the caller as the depositor
                                                │       ├── it should not unlock the v2 veNFT
                                                │       ├── it should merge the v2 veNFT into the migration veNFT
                                                │       ├── it should approve the v3 voting escrow to spend the conversion output
                                                │       ├── it should create a decay v3 staked position with the remaining duration rounded up to weeks
                                                │       ├── it should transfer the v3 staked position to the recipient
                                                │       └── it should emit the VeNFTMigrated event
                                                └── when the rounded duration reaches or exceeds the maximum v3 stake duration
                                                    ├── when the migration parameters are known_
                                                    │   ├── when migration occurs during the first three days of the epoch
                                                    │   │   ├── it should increase the paid basis by the conversion output
                                                    │   │   ├── it should record the caller as the depositor
                                                    │   │   ├── it should not unlock the v2 veNFT
                                                    │   │   ├── it should merge the v2 veNFT into the migration veNFT
                                                    │   │   ├── it should approve the v3 voting escrow to spend the conversion output
                                                    │   │   ├── it should create a decay v3 staked position with the maximum duration
                                                    │   │   ├── it should transfer the v3 staked position to the recipient
                                                    │   │   └── it should emit the VeNFTMigrated event
                                                    │   └── when migration occurs during the final four days of the epoch
                                                    │       ├── it should increase the paid basis by the conversion output
                                                    │       ├── it should record the caller as the depositor
                                                    │       ├── it should not unlock the v2 veNFT
                                                    │       ├── it should merge the v2 veNFT into the migration veNFT
                                                    │       ├── it should approve the v3 voting escrow to spend the conversion output
                                                    │       ├── it should create a decay v3 staked position with the maximum duration
                                                    │       ├── it should transfer the v3 staked position to the recipient
                                                    │       └── it should emit the VeNFTMigrated event
                                                    └── when the migration parameters vary_
                                                        ├── it should increase the paid basis by the conversion output
                                                        ├── it should record the caller as the depositor
                                                        ├── it should not unlock the v2 veNFT
                                                        ├── it should merge the v2 veNFT into the migration veNFT
                                                        ├── it should approve the v3 voting escrow to spend the conversion output
                                                        ├── it should create a decay v3 staked position with the maximum duration
                                                        ├── it should transfer the v3 staked position to the recipient
                                                        └── it should emit the VeNFTMigrated event
